      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont even know what im doing anymore. it just feels like i'm living in this long, grey tunnel and there's no light at the end, just waiting for my dad to finally go. it's like i stopped living months ago and i'm just... still here, going through the motions. i'm so tired of everything.",
